 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Backup and DR Service API (v1) discovery document. Every other official method returns HTTP 501 UNIMPLEMENTED. Backup vaults, backup plans and management servers are configuration metadata: no backup is scheduled or taken, no data is stored or restored, and no management console, appliance or endpoint is deployed; resources report ACTIVE or READY immediately. A backup plan must name an existing backup vault, and a vault cannot be deleted while a plan names it unless ignoreBackupPlanReferences=true. Vault lock times are refused, and allowMissing on delete is not honored. Backup plan associations, data sources, backups and trials remain unimplemented. Long-running operations complete synchronously.",
  "title": "Backup and DR Service (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "v1"
 },
 "openapi": "3.1.0",
